# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RARE runtime state
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# `.rare/` holds live workspace data, not source:
#   .rare/checkpoints/  full file mirrors captured by CheckpointStore before
#                       every self-build. ~2,600 files / ~345 MB, each a copy of
#                       server.ts and src/App.tsx.
#   .rare/state/        durable per-instance documents (may contain user
#                       content — never publish it).
# Both are per-environment and regenerated at runtime. Tracking them published
# private state and made every Tailwind/Vite scan read thousands of duplicate
# sources (which OOM-killed the production build).
.rare/checkpoints/
.rare/state/
# Anything else RARE writes under .rare/ is runtime too; the directory is
# created on demand and needs no tracked contents.
.rare/*
!.rare/.gitkeep

